OL,3,APrivate care home investors a risk to
OL,4,Apublic sector, regulator says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrivate companies buying up care homes
OL,7,Ffor older people in England could
OL,8,Fundermine the government's ambition to
OL,9,Fcreate a universal care service, the
OL,10,Fregulator says.
OL,12,FThe Care Quality Commission's annual
OL,13,Freport highlights how an increasing
OL,14,Fshare of the care home market is owned
OL,15,Fby large firms - the five biggest have
OL,16,Fincreased their share of the market by
OL,17,F26% in the last two years, driven by
OL,18,Finterest from US property investors.
OL,19,FBetween them they own around one in
OL,20,Fseven homes.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
