OL,3,APrivate care home investors a risk to
OL,4,Apublic sector, regulator says
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile there could be benefits, there
OL,7,Fare concerns the trend can lead to
OL,8,Fhigher prices and a reduction in the
OL,9,Fquality of care - something the CQC
OL,10,Fsays needs to be monitored.
OL,12,FMeanwhile, home care, providing support
OL,13,Fto help people wash and dress in their
OL,14,Fown home, has become more fragmented,
OL,15,Fwith a greater number of smaller
OL,16,Fproviders.
